              "text": "29",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na yĩla walikile nyũmba kwake, oosa kavyũ, na akwata ũla mũndũ mũka wake ngombo, na amũaan’ya, mutha na mutha, ilungu ĩkũmi na ilĩ, na amũtwaa mĩvakanĩ yonthe ya Isilaeli. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "JDG.19.29",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "JDG.19.29"
            ]
          }
        },
